43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T21:38:58-07:00","id":595375,"title":"","content":"Anybody here from the <b>Seneca Falls</b> (Or was that <b>Seneca Rises</b> ) or <b>Maple Pass</b> games?<br /> <br /> I was in those and got banned from the first, but only because I didn't cheat properly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T12:11:18-07:00","id":595838,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolf-Man</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/593506-anybody-running-a-online-game?p=595375#post595375\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anybody here from the <b>Seneca Falls</b> (Or was that <b>Seneca Rises</b> ) or <b>Maple Pass</b> games?<br /> <br /> I was in those and got banned from the first, but only because I didn't cheat properly.</div> </div> </div> </div>I started on White Wolf's site back when they had 3 rooms, and it was my go to place for my 'fix'. Tried a few IRC games, including Blood Ties (private server), Ivory and Steel, and Dream's Edge. (And a few I don't remember the names of.) Lime Green Flame (very very briefly). I was around when WoD: New York opened up (web based, almost just like the White Wolf site), but didn't stay long. (Lack of time, nothing wrong with the game at that point.) Went back to White Wolf, went offline for a while (family issues), came back to WoD New York (now under new management) right before it imploded.<br /> <br /> (did a quick search, there are actually some IRC games, but none I am familiar with)<br /> <br /> Darkmyst IRC server seems to have a few games going. Again, can't vouch for any of them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5818,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5818-eviltyger","user":"EvilTyger","date":". 07-19-2015, 03:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5818-eviltyger","name":"EvilTyger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-28T07:09:22-07:00","id":605554,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.wodgotham.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.wodgotham.com\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.wodgotham.com\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.wodgotham.com </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> Is alive and well, and is looking for quality role-players (adults only) who want to dig deep and explore the core themes and struggles of the