M"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-09T11:45:52-07:00","id":658215,"title":"","content":"I just changed my Sig to prove it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T00:41:52-07:00","id":659063,"title":"","content":"Oh I'm sure some are about here.<br /> <br /> What with all the love shared for the game and this being a great place to get updates and ask others of our small community ideas and theories.<br /> <br /> but naturally it seems we can be a flighty and or discrete lot. Possibly due to not wanting ic perceptions reflected on to the infividual player in rl.<br /> <br /> it could be somewhat ironic in that in the opportunity RP has for us to shed a skin and portray sonething else in an element of fun escapism that we then look to escape from being seen as socially by others.<br /> <br /> which I can understand. Some people have difficulty in seperating what they see ic from the person behind the fictional creation of imagination. Which can be difficult on those portraying traits that others don't approve in rl.<br /> <br /> it can get...messy and unnecessary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T04:23:26-07:00","id":1197127,"title":"","content":"Any games like Seneca Falls or Maple Pass from back in 2013 going on today. I'm itching to play again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T05:54:03-07:00","id":1197148,"title":"","content":"Let's not forget <a href=\"https://roll20.net/\" target=\"_blank\">https://roll20.net/</a> a great website for online board-games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23978-tatacavalier","name":"TataCavalier","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T12:19:33-07:00","id":1197289,"title":"","content":"Reading back to when I first asked......City of Angels look very interesting. Is it really a huge game that combines all of them? Not a good idea to do, but very interesting if they have. Anyway does status of the name looking greyed out on the list determine it's availability. Since I have preference to play a Garou, to either be a smarter Fang than last time or just play what they need me to play. . So I fit in better. Quite possibly a very Noobie Lost Pup or Lupus. The admin does a manual confirmation of my rego on their website. So, I'm not sure wether I'm in yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T12:57:45-07:00","id":1197298,"title":"","content":"I'm running a mixed game set in san francisco on discord. Non voice. Lot of new players who are learning how WoD was played on AOL back in the day. We could use more vampires, a couple more changelings and wraiths.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23984-thkaal","name":"Thkaal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T23:05:24-07:00","id":1197499,"title":"","