"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here are two forum games that might perk your interests;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://blackpaw.club/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">https://blackpaw.club/index.php</a> A non-typical werewolf game that allows Lost Tribes (Croatan and Howlers).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://nightgaunt.net/ng/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://nightgaunt.net/ng/index.php</a> A slice of life werewolf game.<br /> <br /> Both are W20.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bBoth those games look like familiar territory to me. I mean the phpBB forums were used in the last game I played. Seneca Falls and the other one. So far the look very inviting and I hope they need new players.<br /> <br /> \u200bSo, Here I go again....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1056,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","user":"Wolf-Man","date":". 04-08-2018, 09:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-08T06:00:32-07:00","id":1204518,"title":"","content":"The best way to join up? Either of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-09T19:35:07-07:00","id":1205062,"title":"","content":"I was able to contact one of them. Still waiting on a reply. I haven't tried registering yet, not till I have a character name attached to my character concept. Thinking of picking a Australian (I can do that real well. Beings a Aussie is first nature to me because I am.) Bone Gnawer (Since I'm a Blue Collar guy.) and Lupus Breed. (Since, I still feel new to the game, and actually a pretty simple guy.) who stowed away on a to ship to a America and was some how, allowed to stay. Not sure what really happens to animals in this situation. I imagine Immigration &amp; any other concerned authority would have me quarantined or sent back. Yet, somehow I managed to get around all that. I was thinking I had close relatives in America, but now realise how unlikely that would be as a dog. Otherwise, I might like to be a pup yet to go through their first change or a lost pup who never really passed their rite of passage trials and was looking for acceptance in other places. That's all I have for now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-11T04:40:39-07:00","id":1205533,"title":"","content":"Myself and a group of friends use VTM:Redemption's multiplayer to host games. One of them regularly brings character models and props from very modern games including The Witcher 3.<br /> <br /> Most of the games are Vampire:The Masquerade or Requiem but I am currently hosting my very first Werewolf chronicle.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://scontent.fopo2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/29472997_1635911956495620_3711159194682916864_n.png?_nc_cat=0&amp;oh=35211fc840066f126f9a0e8a84e5f9f4&amp;oe=5B2F8A3E\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T02:00:34-07:00","id":1223138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/593506-anybody-running-a-online-game?p=1202011#post1202011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here are two forum games that might perk your interests;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://blackpaw.club/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">https://blackpaw.club/index.php</a> A non-typical werewolf game that allows Lost Tribes (Croatan and Howlers).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://nightgaunt.net/ng/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://nightgaunt.net/ng/index.php</a> A slice of life werewolf game.<br /> <br /> Both are W20.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I was a month into the Non-Typical WW game when the person running it decided to cancel it all together. I was kind of enjoying the game, but felt somewhat neglected by the other players for some reason. So, when it fell through, I looked into the other forum game that had been on hiatus all this time for some season, I think. They had advertised several forum WOD games (Some of them WW.) on their forum which all have turned out to be un-active as well. For the time being. I do look forward to another game, but now, I'm really at a loss for making up another character.<br /> <br /> My last character was a Bone Gnawer, Lupus breed, pup or cub named Lucky &amp; I'm not to eager to role play with the last group of people if they didn't me that much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1056,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","user":"Wolf-Man","date":". 05-30-2018, 05:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-19T03:59:32-08:00","id":1268788,"title":"","content":"Anybody from the New Berry Glen game \u2026..<a href=\"http://nightgaunt.net/ng/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://nightgaunt.net/ng/index.php</a><br /> <br /> It's been on hiatus for quite a while, but the forum website is still up. it's like ghost town. Maybe they're still playing, but not there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}